: "PrimalVR", "keywords": ["primal", "vr", "stumble", "guys", "fall"], "long_description": "PrimalVR is a fast-paced multiplayer VR party game where up to 16 players compete through 3 chaotic rounds to see who comes out on top.\n\nRun, climb, dodge, survive, and outplay other players across a growing collection of unique maps and game modes. Every round brings new challenges, unexpected moments, and opportunities to knock out the competition.\n\nCustomize your character with a variety of skins and cosmetics, play with friends or meet new players, and keep coming back as new maps, modes, cosmetics, and features are added.\n\nFeatures include:\n\nUp to 16-player online lobbies\n3-round party matches\nMultiple maps and game modes\nUnlockable skins and cosmetics\nFast-paced VR movement and competition\nRegular new content and updates\n\nWhether you're playing to win or just causing chaos with friends, PrimalVR is built for unpredictable multiplayer fun.", "short_description": "Jump into chaotic 16-player VR party matches! Compete in intense rounds, survive unique maps, unlock skins, and fight to be the last player standing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://stickersvr.github.io/primalvr-privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jahqu", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://stickersvr.github.io/primalvr-privacy/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_pl